V\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(+_V\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\in C\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex}\\vdash\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land C\\subseteq V\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(+_V\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\in C\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convex set: contains all line segments between its points</li>\n<li>Carathéodory: any point in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{conv}(S) \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathrm{conv}(S) \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> is convex combination of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq n+1\">\\(\\leq n+1\\)</span> points</li>\n<li>Helly: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> sets covering all others implies intersection nonempty</li>\n<li>Radon: any set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+2\">\\(n+2\\)</span> points in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> partitioned into two intersecting convex sets</li>\n<li>Krein-Milman: compact convex <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K = \\overline{\\mathrm{conv}}(\\mathrm{ext}(K))\">\\(K = \\overline{\\mathrm{conv}}(\\mathrm{ext}(K))\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rockafellar, Convex Analysis</li>\n<li>Boyd and Vandenberghe, Convex Optimization</li>\n<li>Schneider, Convex Bodies: The Brunn-Minkowski Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+_V,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,+_V,\\odot,C\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+_V,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq\\mathbf V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex}\\vdash\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+_V,\\odot)\\land C\\subseteq V\\land\\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(+_V\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\in C\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{conv}(S) \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq n+1","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"n+2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"K = \\overline{\\mathrm{conv}}(\\mathrm{ext}(K))","display":false}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"afa6c85c498f53e7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a48adc4ce82ceed","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot)$ and $\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-convex]])"},{"id":"e74d03ee2e6041ba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-109","locatio